WEBVTT

00:00:01.545 --> 00:00:04.335
World where I grew up,

00:00:04.335 --> 00:00:08.855
how wondrous and beautiful you are!

00:00:08.855 --> 00:00:11.520
Everything is in my hands

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.290
while I walk,

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:16.335
while I am full of strength.

00:00:16.335 --> 00:00:19.215
To live in the joy of days,

00:00:19.215 --> 00:00:20.635
to burn brightly,

00:00:20.635 --> 00:00:23.765
but not become ash.

00:00:23.765 --> 00:00:26.575
World where I grew up,

00:00:26.575 --> 00:00:30.190
look proudly at who I have become.

00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:33.900
The very, very brightest feeling

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:37.645
The very, very brightest feeling

00:00:37.645 --> 00:00:39.505
You are like art

00:00:39.505 --> 00:00:41.365
You are like art

00:00:41.365 --> 00:00:44.850
You are a bright light

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:48.720
The very, very brightest feeling

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:52.385
The very, very brightest feeling

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:54.195
You are like art

00:00:54.195 --> 00:00:56.110
You are like art

00:00:56.110 --> 00:00:59.600
You are a bright light

00:01:00.585 --> 00:01:04.265
Maybe, someday on this planet,

00:01:04.265 --> 00:01:07.970
in the greatest, greatest trouble,

00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:11.725
In the most derelict, crumbling cottage,

00:01:11.725 --> 00:01:15.275
those next to me won’t be the same.

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:16.940
And I will remember the home

00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:18.885
where I grew up.

00:01:18.885 --> 00:01:20.435
I will remember everything

00:01:20.435 --> 00:01:22.840
so familiar it brings tears:

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:24.205
The river, the greenhouse,

00:01:24.205 --> 00:01:26.570
and your laughter behind the wall,

00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:32.905
Quiet comfort, deep peace.

00:01:32.905 --> 00:01:36.640
The very, very brightest feeling

